Mau mundur ke mana lagi?!

464
00:19:11,066 --> 00:19:11,933
Dorong mereka kembali!

465
00:19:20,466 --> 00:19:21,466
Beri aku setengah hari lagi

466
00:19:21,500 --> 00:19:22,366
Zhenrong pasti jatuh

467
00:19:22,533 --> 00:19:23,300
Tidak

468
00:19:24,700 --> 00:19:26,266
Zhenrong sudah menahan kita tiga hari

469
00:19:26,800 --> 00:19:27,566
Zhenrong belum jatuh

470
00:19:27,700 --> 00:19:28,233
