499
00:20:59,266 --> 00:21:00,533
untuk mengepung Komando Deshun dari arah Wuhui

500
00:21:06,133 --> 00:21:08,433
Yeli Dian ditangkap hidup-hidup!

501
00:21:08,900 --> 00:21:09,200
Ya.

502
00:21:09,433 --> 00:21:11,033
Begitulah yang tertulis di laporan perang.

503
00:21:20,900 --> 00:21:22,966
Kirim ekspres delapan ratus li ke Kabupaten Longcheng

504
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:23,766
Ya

505
00:21:26,600 --> 00:21:27,400
Bocah

506
00:21:28,133 --> 00:21:31,233
Kau benar-benar membawakanku hadiah besar

507
00:21:47,533 --> 00:21:49,133
Guru sudah diangkat kembali lebih awal

508
00:21:49,666 --> 00:21:51,000
Wilayah Perbatasan Barat menyerang besar
-besaran ke Wilayah Perbatasan Selatan

509
00:21:51,333 --> 00:21:52,466
Juga dipercepat

510
00:21:53,166 --> 00:21:53,933
Sejarah

511
00:21:54,700 --> 00:21:55,700
