516
00:22:02,733 --> 00:22:03,866
Tapi baru sampai hari ini

517
00:22:03,900 --> 00:22:04,900
aku benar-benar yakin

518
00:22:05,400 --> 00:22:06,733
Kita sudah benar-benar nyata

519
00:22:06,766 --> 00:22:07,533
mengubah Wilayah Perbatasan Selatan

520
00:22:08,700 --> 00:22:09,300
Pertempuran ini

521
00:22:09,500 --> 00:22:10,266
Tidak bisa hanya bertahan

522
00:22:10,966 --> 00:22:12,233
Harus membagi pasukan jadi dua

523
00:22:12,533 --> 00:22:13,533
Bantuan langsung ke garis depan

524
00:22:13,566 --> 00:22:14,666
Aku akan pergi sendiri!

525
00:22:14,933 --> 00:22:15,966
Sisa pasukan

526
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:16,866
serahkan pada Changfeng

527
00:22:16,900 --> 00:22:17,666
baru berguna besar

528
00:22:34,166 --> 00:22:34,700
Sayang

529
00:22:34,733 --> 00:22:35,566
Jangan menangis lagi.

530
00:22:35,600 --> 00:22:36,500
Aku sudah kembali.

531
00:22:39,333 --> 00:22:40,366
Hongying sudah dimakamkan.

532
00:22:40,400 --> 00:22:41,666
Kamu pergi bersembahyang dulu.

533
00:22:43,300 --> 00:22:43,733
Ya, ya.

534
00:22:43,766 --> 00:22:44,966
Aku pergi sekarang.

535
00:22:45,833 --> 00:22:47,400
Kepala si brengsek Liao Zhong itu

536
00:22:47,433 --> 00:22:48,133
akan kubur di depan makam kakak ipar

537
00:22:48,166 --> 00:22:48,933
