570
00:24:05,366 --> 00:24:05,600
Lapor!

571
00:24:05,633 --> 00:24:06,500
Jenderal Muda!

572
00:24:06,533 --> 00:24:07,400
Perintah Panglima Tertinggi!

573
00:24:13,200 --> 00:24:13,933
Panggil semua orang

574
00:24:13,966 --> 00:24:14,800
rapat di aula utama

575
00:24:16,400 --> 00:24:16,933
Bupati

576
00:24:16,966 --> 00:24:17,833
Seharusnya

577
00:24:17,866 --> 00:24:19,633
Anda adalah kepala daerah ini

578
00:24:19,766 --> 00:24:21,333
Sehari-hari harus mengurus urusan militer

579
00:24:21,366 --> 00:24:22,800
