663
00:26:35,166 --> 00:26:36,700
Pasti bisa bikin mereka porak-poranda

664
00:26:36,733 --> 00:26:38,066
kacau balau

665
00:26:40,566 --> 00:26:41,466
Jenderal Yang benar

666
00:26:41,700 --> 00:26:42,466
Memang harus dihajar begitu

667
00:26:43,900 --> 00:26:45,566
Saat ini di dalam Pengawas Militer Xishou Baotai

668
00:26:45,600 --> 00:26:46,066
sedang kosong

669
00:26:46,500 --> 00:26:47,166
Ayo kita serbu masuk

670
00:26:47,566 --> 00:26:49,133
Bahkan kalau cuma bisa merebut kembali sedikit perbekalan

671
00:26:49,166 --> 00:26:49,866
