686
00:27:09,500 --> 00:27:09,966
Changfeng

687
00:27:10,500 --> 00:27:12,100
Aku hanya membawa lima ratus Kavaleri Busur Silang Qinghe

688
00:27:12,133 --> 00:27:13,266
untuk membantu Komando Deshun

689
00:27:13,300 --> 00:27:13,966
Pasukan kavaleri yang tersisa

690
00:27:14,133 --> 00:27:14,433
