1448
00:53:30,433 --> 00:53:31,366
Begitu para saudara panik

1449
00:53:31,666 --> 00:53:33,566
sisanya langsung dibantai semua

1450
00:53:34,966 --> 00:53:35,600
Jenderal Xie

1451
00:53:36,000 --> 00:53:36,833
Inilah perang

1452
00:53:37,433 --> 00:53:38,933
Jika kau tidak melumpuhkan pasokan mereka

1453
