1569
00:56:32,666 --> 00:56:33,700
Silakan bicara, Jenderal Muda

1570
00:56:33,933 --> 00:56:34,533
Pertama

1571
00:56:34,566 --> 00:56:35,833
Jangan hanya demi mempertahankan satu tempat

1572
00:56:35,866 --> 00:56:37,133
